      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 33,
      "startMs": 336560,
      "endMs": 345620,
      "text": "今天这场是品牌专场，所有货都是官方仓直发，支持专柜验货，假一赔十。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:14:07.152Z"
