      "sessionId": "ae6d96d7-662d-4d13-aa53-881e9254d6a5",
      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 34,
      "startMs": 345740,
      "endMs": 354060,
      "text": "宝宝们有什么问题打在公屏上，我每一条都会看。优先回答带截图的问题。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:14:15.538Z"
    },
    {
