    {
      "id": "32b82583-50f3-4b8c-be16-0afade92f0ee",
      "sessionId": "ae6d96d7-662d-4d13-aa53-881e9254d6a5",
      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 36,
      "startMs": 363020,
      "endMs": 371880,
      "text": "现在库存只剩最后2000单，运营把库存给我锁死，拍完这一轮立刻恢复原价。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:14:33.537Z"
    },
    {
