      "sessionId": "ae6d96d7-662d-4d13-aa53-881e9254d6a5",
      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 37,
      "startMs": 371940,
      "endMs": 381100,
      "text": "老粉都知道，我直播间从来不搞虚的，说送就一定会送，说补库存就一定会补。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:14:42.742Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "c861b94a-4cb9-4d02-a31c-ff857b2c8707",
      "sessionId": "ae6d96d7-662d-4d13-aa53-881e9254d6a5",
      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 38,
      "startMs": 381200,
      "endMs": 389640,
      "text": "最后再强调一遍活动规则，今晚12点前下单，明天上午统一打包发出。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:14:51.093Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ebec0ce-ae4e-415e-af48-3560c0a67cef",
      "sessionId": "ae6d96d7-662d-4d13-aa53-881e9254d6a5",
      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 39,
      "startMs": 389700,
      "endMs": 399420,
      "text": "大家好，欢迎来到直播间。今天给大家带来一款王炸单品，这个真的是我无限回购的一款。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:15:01.185Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "68fa0511-651d-46cc-b2b7-c958fa968bf4",
      "sessionId": "ae6d96d7-662d-4d13-aa53-881e9254d6a5",
      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 40,
      "startMs": 399540,
      "endMs": 410780,
      "text": "家人们，谁懂啊？这个价格我真的会谢。官方旗舰店平时都要300多，今天在我直播间直接给你打下来。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:15:12.341Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a16f5f8-80bc-4cdf-913a-2ec8a3b84785",
      "sessionId": "ae6d96d7-662d-4d13-aa53-881e9254d6a5",
      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 41,
      "startMs": 410880,
      "endMs": 422680,
      "text": "这款精华的核心成分是烟酰胺，浓度5%。坚持用7天，你就能看到肤色明显提亮。这个是实测数据。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:15:24.124Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c168d86-6ae1-4182-adc4-7526dcd6a415",
      "sessionId": "ae6d96d7-662d-4d13-aa53-881e9254d6a5",
      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 42,
      "startMs": 422800,
      "endMs": 432180,
      "text": "来运营，帮我把这个优惠券再上1万张，321上链接，宝宝们直接冲手慢舞。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:15:33.766Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "32f5b1a2-c785-4277-b60d-bf89fc1d677b",
      "sessionId": "ae6d96d7-662d-4d13-aa53-881e9254d6a5",
      "connectionId": "74e12628-d6a8-4990-bdd9-5947b2bc666a",
      "sourceSeq": 43,
      "startMs": 432260,
      "endMs": 442280,
      "text": "很多姐妹问我敏感肌能不能用，我在这里承诺，所有肤质都可以放心食用，没有任何刺激。",
      "isFinal": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T15:15:43.923Z"
    },
